cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below. Cite the associated
  dataset separately, and cite SCEDC and the contributing seismic networks
  for source observations. Cite the associated manuscript when available.
type: software
title: "Causal-SeisField and CA-URC"
version: "1.0.1"
date-released: 2026-10-10
authors:
  - given-names: "Runping"
    family-names: "Ma"
repository-code: "https://github.com/mrp5560/ca-urc-jgr-solid-earth"
url: "https://github.com/mrp5560/ca-urc-jgr-solid-earth"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Research software for retrospective sparse-station ground-motion
  prediction using a target-conditioned Cross-Attention Base and
  underprediction-risk correction (CA-URC). Includes data preparation,
  model training, locked-prediction analysis, and figure scripts. The
  publication package contains selected data samples and archived results,
  not the complete full-record training and label dataset. Derived data
  have a separate CC BY 4.0 license with third-party source exclusions.
keywords:
  - seismology
  - ground motion
  - cross-attention
  - underprediction risk
